  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></math> denote the distinct real roots of the quadratic polynomial <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2020</mn></mrow> </math> and suppose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></math> denote the distinct complex roots of the quadratic polynomial <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2020</mn></math>. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
