  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Finding the sum and product of roots of the two given quadratic equations i.e.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2020</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2020</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><